{"seq":5,"slug":"computational-linguistics","title":"计算语言学","stage":"DONE","category":"linguistics","chapterCount":3,"docCount":18,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 计算语言学 简介\n\n计算语言学是语言学与计算机科学的交叉学科，它运用计算方法来分析、理解和生成人类语言。从早期的规则系统到当今的深度学习模型，计算语言学持续推动着自然语言处理技术的革新，是人工智能领域中最活跃的研究方向之一。\n\n本手册面向有一定编程基础并对语言技术感兴趣的读者，系统介绍计算语言学的核心技术、语言模型的发展脉络和典型应用领域。读者将理解如何用计算方法处理语言问题，并把握当前技术的能力与局限。\n\n全书共分为三章，从基础技术到前沿应用逐步展开：\n\n第一章**NLP 基础**讲解自然语言处理的基础技术流程，包括文本预处理与分词技术、词性标注与命名实体识别方法，以及句法分析的计算实现。\n\n第二章**语言模型**追溯语言模型的技术演进，从统计语言模型的数学基础，到神经网络语言模型的架构创新，再到大语言模型对语言学研究的深远影响。\n\n第三章**计算语言学应用**介绍计算语言学的核心应用领域，包括机器翻译技术的原理与挑战、情感分析与观点挖掘的方法，以及对话系统与语言生成的技术路线。\n\n建议读者先建立 NLP 基础技术的认知框架，再通过语言模型章节理解技术演进的内在逻辑，最后结合应用场景深化对技术价值的理解。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nlp-foundations","title":"NLP 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/nlp-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"text-preprocessing","title":"文本预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/nlp-foundations/text-preprocessing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pos-tagging","title":"词性标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/nlp-foundations/pos-tagging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"parsing-techniques","title":"句法解析技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/nlp-foundations/parsing-techniques"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-models","title":"语言模型","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-lm","title":"统计语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/statistical-lm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-lm","title":"神经网络语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/neural-lm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"llm-linguistics","title":"大语言模型与语言学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/llm-linguistics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"parsing-syntax","title":"语法分析与句法模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/parsing-syntax"},{"seq":5,"slug":"word-embeddings","title":"词嵌入与分布语义学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/word-embeddings"},{"seq":6,"slug":"neural-lm","title":"神经语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/neural-lm"},{"seq":7,"slug":"transformers-llm","title":"Transformer 与大语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/transformers-llm"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cl-applications","title":"计算语言学应用","docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"machine-translation","title":"机器翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/machine-translation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-extraction","title":"信息抽取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/information-extraction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"corpus-linguistics","title":"语料库语言学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/corpus-linguistics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"dialogue-speech","title":"对话系统与语音技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/dialogue-speech"},{"seq":5,"slug":"machine-translation","title":"机器翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/machine-translation"},{"seq":6,"slug":"sentiment-analysis","title":"情感分析与观点挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/sentiment-analysis"},{"seq":7,"slug":"dialogue-systems","title":"对话系统与语言生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/dialogue-systems"},{"seq":8,"slug":"sentiment-analysis","title":"情感分析与观点挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/sentiment-analysis"}]}]}